 r←Test_Init_84(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise `Run` with a dfn `Initial` (a dfn is always ambivalent) that returns 1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.⍎'Initial←{1}'
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 (rc log)←T2.Run 1
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∨/'Looking for a function "Initial": found and executed successfully'⍷∊log

 r←T._OK
